    "CLINK: Compose the geometric, electrostatic, and steric checks into a single contact relation.",
    "AREV: Explore the backtracking alternatives if the primary contact is unstable, reversing the conformational search.",
    "IFIX: Fix the computed contact relation into the contact-map bank as a permanent record.",
    "TANCH: Anchor the result within the enclosing contact-map bank, closing the local interaction."
